tion":5.68,"text":"never get into production."},{"start":82.08,"duration":5.24,"text":"And when you dig into why, it's almost"},{"start":84.64,"duration":5.92,"text":"never the model's fault."},{"start":87.32,"duration":6.2,"text":"The models are extraordinary."},{"start":90.56,"duration":7.8,"text":"The problem is the context we hand them."},{"start":93.52,"duration":6.72,"text":"Ungrounded, disconnected, half relevant."},{"start":98.36,"duration":3.4,"text":"One confident hallucination in front of"},{"start":100.24,"duration":4.84,"text":"a customer,"},{"start":101.76,"duration":6.28,"text":"and the pilot is shut down."},{"start":105.08,"duration":6.52,"text":"The fixed isn't a bigger model."},{"start":108.04,"duration":3.56,"text":"It's a better retrieval."},{"start":113.56,"duration":3.52,"text":"This drawing is basically the whole"},{"start":115.76,"duration":2.76,"text":"talk."},{"start":117.08,"duration":2.76,"text":"Garbage in,"},{"start":118.52,"duration":3.31,"text":"garbage out."},{"start":119.84,"duration":2.52,"text":"If you fed a rag system unconnected"},{"start":121.83,"duration":2.73,"text":"[clears throat]"},{"start":122.36,"duration":5.12,"text":"disorganized data,"},{"start":124.56,"duration":5.52,"text":"you get a garbage answer."},{"start":127.48,"duration":4.28,"text":"Hallucinations, wrong facts, missing"},{"start":130.08,"duration":3.88,"text":"context."},{"start":131.76,"duration":4.64,"text":"The machine isn't broken."},{"start":133.96,"duration":4.08,"text":"The data you are feeding it"},{"start":136.4,"duration":3.68,"text":"is a mess."},{"start":138.04,"duration":3.48,"text":"So, you can't fix this with a bigger"},{"start":140.08,"duration":5.92,"text":"model."},{"start":141.52,"duration":4.48,"text":"You fix it by giving the data structure."},{"start":147.4,"duration":5.36,"text":"Remember that 95%?"},{"start":150.28,"duration":5.48,"text":"Here's a system that doesn't fail."},{"start":152.76,"duration":6.8,"text":"On a public graph rag benchmark,"},{"start":155.76,"duration":7.08,"text":"our graph rag SDK is number one."},{"start":159.56,"duration":5.4,"text":"Almost 82 overall accuracy."},{"start":162.84,"duration":6.88,"text":"Compare it to the vector rag with only"},{"start":164.96,"duration":7.84,"text":"55 overall accuracy. That's 26 points"},{"start":169.72,"duration":4.92,"text":"gap just from adding a graph."},{"start":172.8,"duration":4.56,"text":"26 points"},{"start":174.64,"duration":6.24,"text":"is the difference between a demo and"},{"start":177.36,"duration":3.52,"text":"something you actually ship."},{"start":182.88,"duration":5.68,"text":"Here's a question, a real one. Which of"},{"start":185.52,"duration":4.6,"text":"my customers are in a city where I have"},{"start":188.56,"duration":2.92,"text":"an office?"},{"start":190.12,"duration":2.76,"text":"To you,"},{"start":191.48,"duration":3.72,"text":"that's easy."},{"start":192.88,"duration":5.72,"text":"To a normal rag system,"},{"start":195.2,"duration":5.72,"text":"it's a trap and it will fail it"},{"start":198.6,"duration":4.52,"text":"because there is no single chunk of text"},{"start":200.92,"duration":4.12,"text":"anywhere that say this."},{"start":203.12,"duration":5.4,"text":"Your customer location"},{"start":205.04,"duration":5.32,"text":"live lives in one document."},{"start":208.52,"duration":3.64,"text":"Your office locations"},{"start":210.36,"duration":4.36,"text":"lives in another."},{"start":212.16,"duration":4.96,"text":"Vector cells are nothing to match and"},{"start":214.72,"duration":4.0,"text":"that's exactly the a gap"},{"start":217.12,"duration":5.32,"text":"a graph closes."},{"start":218.72,"duration":3.72,"text":"We will come to this question later."},{"start":223.96,"duration":5.76,"text":"Almost everyone here has shipped a rag"},{"start":225.84,"duration":5.68,"text":"pipeline and almost every one of them"},{"start":229.72,"duration":4.44,"text":"at some point"},{"start":231.52,"duration":4.88,"text":"confidentially made something up."},{"start":234.16,"duration":4.28,"text":"So, we know the loop."},{"start":236.4,"duration":4.64,"text":"Chunk your documents, embed them, and"},{"start":238.44,"duration":4.4,"text":"store them in a vector database."},{"start":241.04,"duration":4.16,"text":"And at query time,"},{"start":242.84,"duration":4.8,"text":"pull back the top K chunks that looks"},{"start":245.2,"duration":5.28,"text":"like your question."},{"start":247.64,"duration":5.0,"text":"But, look at what you get."},{"start":250.48,"duration":4.04,"text":"A pile of chunk."},{"start":252.64,"duration":5.84,"text":"A flat list."},{"start":254.52,"duration":5.64,"text":"Nothing connects fact A in chunk three"},{"start":258.48,"duration":5.68,"text":"to fact"},{"start":260.16,"duration":4.0,"text":"B in chunk 47."},{"start":267.6,"duration":5.8,"text":"So, where this system broke breaks? I"},{"start":270.36,"duration":5.12,"text":"want to talk about four points."},{"start":273.4,"duration":4.96,"text":"The first The first one is about"},{"start":275.48,"duration":5.08,"text":"multi-hop reasoning."},{"start":278.36,"duration":4.2,"text":"If your question require multi-hop"},{"start":280.56,"duration":5.24,"text":"multi-hop knowledge,"},{"start":282.56,"duration":5.2,"text":"for example, people to people to event"},{"start":285.8,"duration":4.2,"text":"to a job,"},{"start":287.76,"duration":6.48,"text":"we need to extract the knowledge that"},{"start":290.0,"duration":7.88,"text":"leaves behind similarity."},{"start":294.24,"duration":3.64,"text":"And the flat list can do that."},{"start":297.92,"duration":4.88,"text":"If you're talking about concepts, like"},{"start":299.92,"duration":5.48,"text":"if you search about girl or any one of"},{"start":302.8,"duration":5.48,"text":"you or like this event, there is no"},{"start":305.4,"duration":5.76,"text":"grounding in vector search. So, your"},{"start":308.28,"duration":4.48,"text":"concept is across the documents, and you"},{"start":311.16,"duration":3.52,"text":"need to find"},{"start":312.76,"duration":5.36,"text":"all the concept and to understand if"},{"start":314.68,"duration":5.84,"text":"it's relevant to your question or not."},{"start":318.12,"duration":6.2,"text":"When you add documents,"},{"start":320.52,"duration":7.12,"text":"you only add more and more vectors."},{"start":324.32,"duration":5.88,"text":"So, you add noise, and you need to find"},{"start":327.64,"duration":5.76,"text":"the relevant concept that with with"},{"start":330.2,"duration":5.04,"text":"database that doesn't scale."},{"start":333.4,"duration":3.92,"text":"And when you eventually get to the ask"},{"start":335.24,"duration":5.16,"text":"the question,"},{"start":337.32,"duration":4.96,"text":"you only extract K chunks."},{"start":340.4,"duration":5.44,"text":"And you don't know if your"},{"start":342.28,"duration":6.64,"text":"uh relevant information it it is in the"},{"start":345.84,"duration":3.08,"text":"K plus one chunk."},{"start":353.2,"duration":4.2,"text":"I'm sure most of you already know this."},{"start":355.84,"duration":3.24,"text":"But just in case,"},{"start":357.4,"duration":3.24,"text":"a knowledge graph is the simplest"},{"start":359.08,"duration":3.16,"text":"structure there is."},{"start":360.64,"duration":4.24,"text":"Nodes"},{"start":362.24,"duration":4.4,"text":"are the entities, the things your data"},{"start":364.88,"duration":5.36,"text":"is about."},{"start":366.64,"duration":6.64,"text":"People, places, products."},{"start":370.24,"duration":4.32,"text":"Edges are the relationship between them,"},{"start":373.28,"duration":4.04,"text":"typed"},{"start":374.56,"duration":6.04,"text":"and directional."},{"start":377.32,"duration":5.36,"text":"And the key idea, the fact,"},{"start":380.6,"duration":5.8,"text":"lives on the edge."},{"start":382.68,"duration":7.76,"text":"Alice founded founded Falco DB"},{"start":386.4,"duration":6.32,"text":"isn't a sentence to be read every time."},{"start":390.44,"duration":5.72,"text":"It's one edge."},{"start":392.72,"duration":7.28,"text":"Alice founded Falco DB."},{"start":396.16,"duration":8.8,"text":"Falco DB based in London."},{"start":400.0,"duration":7.56,"text":"Falco DB builds graph right SDK."},{"start":404.96,"duration":6.04,"text":"Same picture you sketch on a whiteboard,"},{"start":407.56,"duration":7.2,"text":"except now it's queryable. And the SDK"},{"start":411.0,"duration":3.76,"text":"does this automatically."},{"start":417.12,"duration":4.24,"text":"Yeah."},{"start":419.28,"duration":4.76,"text":"Back to the question from earlier."},{"start":421.36,"duration":5.56,"text":"To a human, easy."},{"start":424.04,"duration":6.68,"text":"To vector search, a trap."},{"start":426.92,"duration":6.44,"text":"Because the the two facts live in"},{"start":430.72,"duration":5.08,"text":"different chunks. Top K graphs, whatever"},{"start":433.36,"duration":4.28,"text":"looks like your the question."},{"start":435.8,"duration":3.72,"text":"And the two facts that are relevant"},{"start":437.64,"duration":3.28,"text":"never ends up in the same context"},{"start":439.52,"duration":2.88,"text":"window."},{"start":440.92,"duration":3.16,"text":"So, the model"},{"start":442.4,"duration":3.96,"text":"guesses."},{"start":444.08,"duration":3.2,"text":"But a graph already has the joint built"},{"start":446.36,"duration":4.24,"text":"in."},{"start":447.28,"duration":5.52,"text":"Customer to city, back to office."},{"start":450.6,"duration":3.6,"text":"That's a path you can walk."},{"start":452.8,"duration":4.76,"text":"Two hops,"},{"start":454.2,"duration":5.12,"text":"one query. The answer isn't retrieved,"},{"start":457.56,"duration":3.36,"text":"it's traversed,"},{"start":459.32,"duration":5.92,"text":"and it's grounded."},{"start":460.92,"duration":4.32,"text":"Because every step is a real edge."},{"start":465.84,"duration":3.32,"text":"That's it. You don't throw anything"},{"start":468.04,"duration":4.84,"text":"away."},{"start":469.16,"duration":6.36,"text":"Look at these two sides. On the left,"},{"start":472.88,"duration":6.08,"text":"your documents and their chunks. Only"},{"start":475.52,"duration":5.76,"text":"now they are connected."},{"start":478.96,"duration":5.2,"text":"Chunks to chunks and to the source"},{"start":481.28,"duration":5.32,"text":"documents. On the right, you have the"},{"start":484.16,"duration":5.44,"text":"entities and relationship"},{"start":486.6,"duration":4.8,"text":"from the original chunks."},{"start":489.6,"duration":3.4,"text":"The information is just with"},{"start":491.4,"duration":4.04,"text":"representation"},{"start":493.0,"duration":4.32,"text":"as a graph."},{"start":495.44,"duration":3.8,"text":"Put them together"},{"start":497.32,"duration":4.32,"text":"and you can use"},{"start":499.24,"duration":5.92,"text":"this graph to walk from document to"},{"start":501.64,"duration":4.88,"text":"chunk to entity to entity to entity and"},{"start":505.16,"duration":4.6,"text":"then to chunk."},{"start":506.52,"duration":6.24,"text":"And you can connect two documents with"},{"start":509.76,"duration":5.56,"text":"same relationships that lives"},{"start":512.76,"duration":2.56,"text":"in them."},{"start":517.08,"duration":3.8,"text":"So, how"},{"start":519.12,"duration":4.28,"text":"So, how do we build it?"},{"start":520.88,"duration":4.72,"text":"The first two steps are identical to"},{"start":523.4,"duration":3.8,"text":"vanilla rag."},{"start":525.6,"duration":3.36,"text":"Take your documents, split them into"},{"start":527.2,"duration":3.04,"text":"chunks."},{"start":528.96,"duration":4.32,"text":"Only now"},{"start":530.24,"duration":5.96,"text":"you need to extract entities."},{"start":533.28,"duration":4.24,"text":"This is where the graph came come from."},{"start":536.2,"duration":4.16,"text":"Extraction."},{"start":537.52,"duration":5.72,"text":"We use an LLM to extract entities and"},{"start":540.36,"duration":4.72,"text":"and and relationships. Then, we need to"},{"start":543.24,"duration":4.72,"text":"resolve them"},{"start":545.08,"duration":4.6,"text":"uh in order to deduplicate"},{"start":547.96,"duration":3.84,"text":"the graph and"},{"start":549.68,"duration":4.92,"text":"reduce the noise."},{"start":551.8,"duration":5.36,"text":"At the end, we get a a full knowledge"},{"start":554.6,"duration":3.84,"text":"graph linked and embedded."},{"start":557.16,"duration":3.52,"text":"And that's it."},{"start":558.44,"duration":5.48,"text":"Same embedding as vector,"},{"start":560.68,"duration":4.64,"text":"same same chunks. Only now with"},{"start":563.92,"duration":5.16,"text":"connections"},{"start":565.32,"duration":3.76,"text":"and that we can traverse."},{"start":573.48,"duration":5.44,"text":"How does text become a graph?"},{"start":576.36,"duration":5.36,"text":"It's an entity extraction"},{"start":578.92,"duration":5.08,"text":"We found out that using two models for"},{"start":581.72,"duration":3.52,"text":"extraction is more accurate and fast and"},{"start":584.0,"duration":4.2,"text":"faster."},{"start":585.24,"duration":6.24,"text":"The first the first step is a is done"},{"start":588.2,"duration":6.0,"text":"doing done by local name entity entity"},{"start":591.48,"duration":4.84,"text":"recognition model, Gleaner."},{"start":594.2,"duration":5.04,"text":"This model is optimized to extract"},{"start":596.32,"duration":4.96,"text":"entity based on a given ontology."},{"start":599.24,"duration":5.12,"text":"It's local, it's fast, run by"},{"start":601.28,"duration":5.12,"text":"milliseconds, and zero API cost."},{"start":604.36,"duration":4.48,"text":"Free."},{"start":606.4,"duration":6.4,"text":"At the output, we get entities."},{"start":608.84,"duration":6.76,"text":"Alice, Faculty B, London."},{"start":612.8,"duration":5.88,"text":"And then we are using LLM to verify"},{"start":615.6,"duration":5.08,"text":"those entities and extract relationship"},{"start":618.68,"duration":3.36,"text":"between them."},{"start":620.68,"duration":3.44,"text":"The output"},{"start":622.04,"duration":5.2,"text":"is a complete knowledge graph."},{"start":624.12,"duration":5.08,"text":"Now Alice connected to Faculty B with"},{"start":627.24,"duration":4.96,"text":"real edge."},{"start":629.2,"duration":6.36,"text":"Faculty B connected to London"},{"start":632.2,"duration":3.36,"text":"with also a real edge."},{"start":637.84,"duration":3.92,"text":"Now we have"},{"start":639.88,"duration":4.92,"text":"we have extracted entities. And"},{"start":641.76,"duration":5.84,"text":"sometimes we got duplications. For"},{"start":644.8,"duration":5.44,"text":"example, from documents we can get a"},{"start":647.6,"duration":4.84,"text":"several men mentioning names like Nova,"},{"start":650.24,"duration":5.96,"text":"Novacorp, and Nova Inc."},{"start":652.44,"duration":5.04,"text":"We want to deduplicate this"},{"start":656.2,"duration":3.36,"text":"this"},{"start":657.48,"duration":4.76,"text":"entities in order to get a single"},{"start":659.56,"duration":6.92,"text":"representation on our graph"},{"start":662.24,"duration":6.8,"text":"and to know that every time we when we"},{"start":666.48,"duration":4.56,"text":"search for concept, we return to a"},{"start":669.04,"duration":3.8,"text":"single representation."},{"start":671.04,"duration":5.08,"text":"This is how it scales."},{"start":672.84,"duration":6.36,"text":"And we're doing that but by taking these"},{"start":676.12,"duration":4.36,"text":"entities and created communities."},{"start":679.2,"duration":4.28,"text":"A similar"},{"start":680.48,"duration":5.48,"text":"a similar semantic groups. For example,"},{"start":683.48,"duration":4.6,"text":"Nova and Novacorp in one group"},{"start":685.96,"duration":4.48,"text":"and Apple in another."},{"start":688.08,"duration":4.96,"text":"Then we extract the entities that look"},{"start":690.44,"duration":4.6,"text":"similar on the graph"},{"start":693.04,"duration":4.44,"text":"and create batches."},{"start":695.04,"duration":5.28,"text":"Each batches we give to the LLM to"},{"start":697.48,"duration":4.08,"text":"decide if to merge these entities or"},{"start":700.32,"duration":3.0,"text":"not."},{"start":701.56,"duration":4.08,"text":"At the end we get the the single"},{"start":703.32,"duration":4.68,"text":"representation and unified knowledge"},{"start":705.64,"duration":7.08,"text":"graph. This is how when you add"},{"start":708.0,"duration":7.0,"text":"documents and add same entities, they"},{"start":712.72,"duration":3.44,"text":"return and merge to the entities in the"},{"start":715.0,"duration":3.96,"text":"graph"},{"start":716.16,"duration":5.04,"text":"and we can add and add documents and the"},{"start":718.96,"duration":4.68,"text":"concept is single of the graph in the"},{"start":721.2,"duration":2.44,"text":"graph."},{"start":727.2,"duration":5.88,"text":"By now,"},{"start":729.04,"duration":5.12,"text":"we know a little bit a bit how to build"},{"start":733.08,"duration":3.92,"text":"a graph"},{"start":734.16,"duration":5.64,"text":"and what is what is it look like."},{"start":737.0,"duration":4.08,"text":"Let's talk about how we retrieve it."},{"start":739.8,"duration":4.76,"text":"For example,"},{"start":741.08,"duration":5.76,"text":"when we query a question, we now can"},{"start":744.56,"duration":4.92,"text":"take this question and find entry point"},{"start":746.84,"duration":3.88,"text":"in the graph. For example, Alice and"},{"start":749.48,"duration":3.4,"text":"London."},{"start":750.72,"duration":4.08,"text":"And now we can use the graph that we"},{"start":752.88,"duration":4.52,"text":"built to"},{"start":754.8,"duration":6.56,"text":"do a multi-hop reasoning."},{"start":757.4,"duration":7.12,"text":"We are the one hop to to walk out, then"},{"start":761.36,"duration":5.56,"text":"to base in, and expand it to other"},{"start":764.52,"duration":5.12,"text":"information that we want. Think what you"},{"start":766.92,"duration":6.96,"text":"can do with it when the agent can"},{"start":769.64,"duration":4.24,"text":"control the hops."},{"start":774.36,"duration":5.0,"text":"Let's get more specific."},{"start":776.24,"duration":6.72,"text":"When we query a question, we extract"},{"start":779.36,"duration":5.08,"text":"keywords and embed them. And now finding"},{"start":782.96,"duration":4.04,"text":"the entry point"},{"start":784.44,"duration":4.8,"text":"and the route between them. This is the"},{"start":787.0,"duration":3.68,"text":"power of graph."},{"start":789.24,"duration":4.48,"text":"Only now"},{"start":790.68,"duration":3.96,"text":"we have the edges and the fact between"},{"start":793.72,"duration":4.08,"text":"them."},{"start":794.64,"duration":5.6,"text":"For example, Alice co-founded Faculty B"},{"start":797.8,"duration":4.64,"text":"in 2023"},{"start":800.24,"duration":5.24,"text":"is a fact that live in your original"},{"start":802.44,"duration":5.56,"text":"chunks and now it's on the database"},{"start":805.48,"duration":4.0,"text":"connecting the two concepts, Alice and"},{"start":808.0,"duration":3.4,"text":"Faculty B."},{"start":809.48,"duration":2.88,"text":"We extract this structure and re-rank"},{"start":811.4,"duration":3.04,"text":"it."},{"start":812.36,"duration":6.32,"text":"And then give it"},{"start":814.44,"duration":4.24,"text":"give this complete context to the LLM."},{"start":820.2,"duration":6.28,"text":"Every answer cited its source. The"},{"start":823.24,"duration":5.2,"text":"answer Alice works at Faculty B didn't"},{"start":826.48,"duration":4.76,"text":"come from nowhere."},{"start":828.44,"duration":6.64,"text":"It resolved to the entity Alice,"},{"start":831.24,"duration":6.4,"text":"which as mentioned in this exact chunk,"},{"start":835.08,"duration":5.36,"text":"which is part of this document,"},{"start":837.64,"duration":4.88,"text":"company profile.md,"},{"start":840.44,"duration":4.88,"text":"for example."},{"start":842.52,"duration":4.68,"text":"So, when someone asks, \"Why did the the"},{"start":845.32,"duration":3.96,"text":"system say that?\""},{"start":847.2,"duration":3.4,"text":"you show the trail."},{"start":849.28,"duration":3.72,"text":"That's it."},{"start":850.6,"duration":3.56,"text":"The score, the the source sentence, the"},{"start":853.0,"duration":3.8,"text":"file,"},{"start":854.16,"duration":6.48,"text":"that's the difference between black box"},{"start":856.8,"duration":6.48,"text":"and knowing exactly where your answer"},{"start":860.64,"duration":2.64,"text":"came from."},{"start":864.88,"duration":3.72,"text":"Everything I'm showing you package and"},{"start":867.16,"duration":4.76,"text":"it's open source."},{"start":868.6,"duration":5.92,"text":"Point uh the Graph Rag SDK is one simple"},{"start":871.92,"duration":4.76,"text":"API, point it at your documents, and you"},{"start":874.52,"duration":4.36,"text":"extract uh and you build the the"},{"start":876.68,"duration":4.48,"text":"knowledge graph, and then you can ask."},{"start":878.88,"duration":5.84,"text":"It's built on Faculty B, including"},{"start":881.16,"duration":5.6,"text":"vector and full text index"},{"start":884.72,"duration":4.6,"text":"uh in one engine."},{"start":886.76,"duration":5.16,"text":"Automatic extraction and reservation"},{"start":889.32,"duration":5.92,"text":"reso- resolution, every answer is"},{"start":891.92,"duration":3.32,"text":"grounded and cited."},{"start":896.56,"duration":2.8,"text":"Okay. Let [snorts] me show you a quick"},{"start":898.2,"duration":4.68,"text":"demo."},{"start":899.36,"duration":5.4,"text":"Uh we uh built a demo of an application"},{"start":902.88,"duration":4.8,"text":"with this Graph Rag SDK,"},{"start":904.76,"duration":5.92,"text":"uh ingesting a document, and then ask"},{"start":907.68,"duration":5.92,"text":"the question from earlier."},{"start":910.68,"duration":5.52,"text":"Um this is the first step. We ingest the"},{"start":913.6,"duration":4.24,"text":"documents, the all the steps of of uh"},{"start":916.2,"duration":3.4,"text":"creating the graph."},{"start":917.84,"duration":3.64,"text":"Then we have extracted entities and"},{"start":919.6,"duration":5.32,"text":"relationship. The graph looks like this."},{"start":921.48,"duration":6.12,"text":"We can see how the databases look like."},{"start":924.92,"duration":4.68,"text":"We have a visual"},{"start":927.6,"duration":3.92,"text":"and then"},{"start":929.6,"duration":4.68,"text":"we can ask our question,"},{"start":931.52,"duration":5.48,"text":"go to the database, search, traverse,"},{"start":934.28,"duration":5.08,"text":"and we rank, and now we can build the"},{"start":937.0,"duration":6.28,"text":"question and"},{"start":939.36,"duration":3.92,"text":"connect it to the source chunks."},{"start":947.32,"duration":5.12,"text":"Nothing's free."},{"start":949.0,"duration":4.72,"text":"So, that be Let Let me be straight with"},{"start":952.44,"duration":3.48,"text":"you."},{"start":953.72,"duration":4.76,"text":"Creating a graph"},{"start":955.92,"duration":5.0,"text":"is cost you an LLM tokens and a"},{"start":958.48,"duration":5.64,"text":"processing time. The extraction, the"},{"start":960.92,"duration":4.68,"text":"resolution, the incremental updates, the"},{"start":964.12,"duration":3.92,"text":"deduplication"},{"start":965.6,"duration":5.04,"text":"has its own processing time and it take"},{"start":968.04,"duration":5.08,"text":"tokens."},{"start":970.64,"duration":3.48,"text":"But, at the end, you get a database that"},{"start":973.12,"duration":2.8,"text":"you can"},{"start":974.12,"duration":5.0,"text":"reuse."},{"start":975.92,"duration":5.96,"text":"An accuracy and trust that vectors alone"},{"start":979.12,"duration":2.76,"text":"can give you."},{"start":983.68,"duration":6.24,"text":"This is one graph that goes with you."},{"start":987.16,"duration":5.24,"text":"It's multi-tenant, one graph per tenant,"},{"start":989.92,"duration":4.72,"text":"how this relation. It's incremental, you"},{"start":992.4,"duration":5.16,"text":"update and delete."},{"start":994.64,"duration":6.24,"text":"You don't rebuild it from scratch."},{"start":997.56,"duration":5.16,"text":"It's efficient because you traverse and"},{"start":1000.88,"duration":3.52,"text":"the relevant sub-graph, not the whole"},{"start":1002.72,"duration":4.56,"text":"thing."},{"start":1004.4,"duration":4.56,"text":"And it's fast, sub-milliseconds queries"},{"start":1007.28,"duration":4.52,"text":"on Faculty B."},{"start":1008.96,"duration":6.96,"text":"Add gra- Add data, add tenant, add"},{"start":1011.8,"duration":4.12,"text":"traffic, the the graph keeps up."},{"start":1016.92,"duration":5.56,"text":"Okay. So, everything I've shown you"},{"start":1019.84,"duration":4.56,"text":"until now runs on one engine, Faculty B,"},{"start":1022.48,"duration":4.28,"text":"the graph database. It's including the"},{"start":1024.4,"duration":5.52,"text":"vector search, the full text, like I"},{"start":1026.76,"duration":5.12,"text":"told you, and all runs on Graph Blast"},{"start":1029.92,"duration":5.04,"text":"and in milliseconds. Let me show you"},{"start":1031.88,"duration":7.56,"text":"three more use cases that we at Faculty"},{"start":1034.96,"duration":6.92,"text":"B built with AI to solve problems."},{"start":1039.44,"duration":4.8,"text":"Um"},{"start":1041.88,"duration":3.28,"text":"The fifth use case is your own code"},{"start":1044.24,"duration":4.08,"text":"base."},{"start":1045.16,"duration":4.8,"text":"Point code graph at any repo and it"},{"start":1048.32,"duration":2.6,"text":"turns your code base into a knowledge"},{"start":1049.96,"duration":3.92,"text":"graph."},{"start":1050.92,"duration":5.76,"text":"Modules, classes, functions connected by"},{"start":1053.88,"duration":5.96,"text":"calls, inheritance, depends on."},{"start":1056.68,"duration":6.4,"text":"You can trace code, run impact analysis,"},{"start":1059.84,"duration":5.68,"text":"and literally chat with your code base."},{"start":1063.08,"duration":4.44,"text":"And it ships an MCP server, so Cloud"},{"start":1065.52,"duration":5.32,"text":"Code and Cursur"},{"start":1067.52,"duration":7.08,"text":"can query it directly. Think of it."},{"start":1070.84,"duration":8.2,"text":"Your code base as an architecture of"},{"start":1074.6,"duration":4.44,"text":"uh graph. Calls, functions, models."},{"start":1080.28,"duration":2.84,"text":"Query Weaver"},{"start":1083.52,"duration":5.56,"text":"is is open source text to SQL."},{"start":1086.08,"duration":5.64,"text":"You ask your existing MySQL or Postgres"},{"start":1089.08,"duration":3.88,"text":"database a question in plain English."},{"start":1091.72,"duration":4.32,"text":"The trick is"},{"start":1092.96,"duration":4.92,"text":"graph semantic layer. We basically take"},{"start":1096.04,"duration":4.52,"text":"your relational schema uh relational"},{"start":1097.88,"duration":5.92,"text":"database schema and represent it as a"},{"start":1100.56,"duration":5.28,"text":"semantic layer on the graph."},{"start":1103.8,"duration":4.8,"text":"What we can achieve with that that when"},{"start":1105.84,"duration":6.2,"text":"you ask question, we can retrieve sub"},{"start":1108.6,"duration":6.96,"text":"graph of your schema, give it to the LLM"},{"start":1112.04,"duration":5.32,"text":"in order to create SQL query."},{"start":1115.56,"duration":3.08,"text":"For example, if you have"},{"start":1117.36,"duration":3.12,"text":"table"},{"start":1118.64,"duration":3.96,"text":"one and table two, and your question"},{"start":1120.48,"duration":4.4,"text":"talking about this table, but in order"},{"start":1122.6,"duration":4.68,"text":"to create complete SQL, you need a"},{"start":1124.88,"duration":4.92,"text":"connection table that semantic not"},{"start":1127.28,"duration":4.0,"text":"connecting uh or similar to your"},{"start":1129.8,"duration":3.24,"text":"question."},{"start":1131.28,"duration":2.92,"text":"Only if if you have the route between"},{"start":1133.04,"duration":2.92,"text":"this table,"},{"start":1134.2,"duration":5.0,"text":"you can understand it."},{"start":1135.96,"duration":5.56,"text":"And you can use it without all schema."},{"start":1139.2,"duration":5.92,"text":"Maybe your schema is large and you can"},{"start":1141.52,"duration":3.6,"text":"get it into the context window."},{"start":1145.44,"duration":6.04,"text":"And finally, memory to your agent."},{"start":1149.04,"duration":4.8,"text":"Agent forget anything between sessions."},{"start":1151.48,"duration":5.92,"text":"Give them graph memory and their memory"},{"start":1153.84,"duration":5.68,"text":"becomes relationship instead of a flat"},{"start":1157.4,"duration":3.72,"text":"text. Alice"},{"start":1159.52,"duration":2.68,"text":"follows diet vegan."},{"start":1161.12,"duration":3.36,"text":"Alice"},{"start":1162.2,"duration":5.48,"text":"lives in London."},{"start":1164.48,"duration":5.76,"text":"Now the agent can reason across facts,"},{"start":1167.68,"duration":4.36,"text":"not just retrieve them."},{"start":1170.24,"duration":4.04,"text":"And it's sub-milliseconds."},{"start":1172.04,"duration":5.6,"text":"It plugs into Graphity, Cogney, Mem"},{"start":1174.28,"duration":3.36,"text":"Zero, and LangChain."},{"start":1178.52,"duration":4.6,"text":"Okay, wrap it up."},{"start":1180.56,"duration":4.0,"text":"The system that I've shown you today"},{"start":1183.12,"duration":6.36,"text":"leverages the powerful graph"},{"start":1184.56,"duration":4.92,"text":"capabilities to solve problems with AI."},{"start":1190.76,"duration":4.28,"text":"All run on Faculty B, a graph engine,"},{"start":1193.72,"duration":4.16,"text":"and"},{"start":1195.04,"duration":3.84,"text":"the use cases are connected here in this"},{"start":1197.88,"duration":2.8,"text":"uh slide."},{"start":1198.88,"duration":3.32,"text":"It's open source."},{"start":1200.68,"duration":4.4,"text":"Go try it."},{"start":1202.2,"duration":5.48,"text":"You can use it with Docker and run it"},{"start":1205.08,"duration":6.64,"text":"and we you don't need to pay anything."},{"start":1207.68,"duration":4.04,"text":"Just use it without limitation."},{"start":1212.56,"duration":2.84,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":1213.72,"duration":4.2,"text":"This is the QR code for the Graph AI"},{"start":1215.4,"duration":3.57,"text":"SDK. I will be around for your"},{"start":1217.92,"duration":3.07,"text":"questions."},{"start":1218.97,"duration":2.02,"text":">> [applause]"},{"start":1236.16,"duration":4.6,"text":">> Okay, just quick announcement for people"},{"start":1238.96,"duration":3.8,"text":"who may have questions. In order for you"},{"start":1240.76,"duration":4.2,"text":"to ask the questions, you have to submit"},{"start":1242.76,"duration":4.36,"text":"them through the app. You will see a"},{"start":1244.96,"duration":4.44,"text":"section where you can submit questions."},{"start":1247.12,"duration":2.68,"text":"But I have two questions for you."},{"start":1249.4,"duration":3.72,"text":">> Yeah."},{"start":1249.8,"duration":6.16,"text":">> So one is from Johan. He says, \"I see"},{"start":1253.12,"duration":5.92,"text":"vector databases are all are all over."},{"start":1255.96,"duration":4.48,"text":"What does Falcon do better?\""},{"start":1259.04,"duration":3.81,"text":">> I can answer it, but I want to do a"},{"start":1260.44,"duration":4.32,"text":"selfie before."},{"start":1262.85,"duration":2.55,"text":">> [laughter]"},{"start":1264.76,"duration":2.72,"text":">> With you."},{"start":1265.4,"duration":2.08,"text":">> Yeah."},{"start":1271.32,"duration":3.0,"text":">> Okay."},{"start":1272.76,"duration":4.76,"text":"Um"},{"start":1274.32,"duration":7.2,"text":"What Faulko do better?"},{"start":1277.52,"duration":4.72,"text":"So, vector vector database are simple."},{"start":1281.52,"duration":3.36,"text":"Uh"},{"start":1282.24,"duration":5.52,"text":"it's cheap. You just put your documents,"},{"start":1284.88,"duration":5.12,"text":"create vectors from each chunk, and"},{"start":1287.76,"duration":5.04,"text":"simple to to run it."},{"start":1290.0,"duration":5.08,"text":"What Faulko DB brings and graph database"},{"start":1292.8,"duration":3.56,"text":"brings is the connection between these"},{"start":1295.08,"duration":4.0,"text":"chunks."},{"start":1296.36,"duration":4.4,"text":"Now, with graph, you can connect with"},{"start":1299.08,"duration":2.28,"text":"entities,"},{"start":1300.76,"duration":3.56,"text":"um"},{"start":1301.36,"duration":4.92,"text":"and you you also connect the the chunks."},{"start":1304.32,"duration":4.2,"text":"The the simplest way is you connect the"},{"start":1306.28,"duration":3.36,"text":"chunks. And now you can walk on the"},{"start":1308.52,"duration":3.4,"text":"chunks."},{"start":1309.64,"duration":4.92,"text":"Um"},{"start":1311.92,"duration":6.28,"text":"So, basically, Faulko DB brings the"},{"start":1314.56,"duration":5.24,"text":"vector DB into graph. So, you have the"},{"start":1318.2,"duration":3.28,"text":"vector"},{"start":1319.8,"duration":3.68,"text":"uh index in them."},{"start":1321.48,"duration":3.32,"text":"And you can use the"},{"start":1323.48,"duration":3.0,"text":"the edges"},{"start":1324.8,"duration":3.2,"text":"For example, for example, about the"},{"start":1326.48,"duration":4.24,"text":"Query Weaver,"},{"start":1328.0,"duration":4.04,"text":"uh you can like store your schema as a"},{"start":1330.72,"duration":4.64,"text":"vector DB."},{"start":1332.04,"duration":5.32,"text":"But let's say you want a table that has"},{"start":1335.36,"duration":4.64,"text":"connection to a uh with with a business"},{"start":1337.36,"duration":5.12,"text":"logic to other table or other"},{"start":1340.0,"duration":4.64,"text":"information. Now, when you extract"},{"start":1342.48,"duration":4.04,"text":"knowledge, it it came with the"},{"start":1344.64,"duration":4.16,"text":"connection, and you can extract the"},{"start":1346.52,"duration":4.04,"text":"knowledge to complete the information"},{"start":1348.8,"duration":6.04,"text":"that LLM need"},{"start":1350.56,"duration":6.28,"text":"uh needs to create the sequel."},{"start":1354.84,"duration":3.52,"text":"I hope that"},{"start":1356.84,"duration":4.44,"text":">> I hope that answered the question, too."},{"start":1358.36,"duration":5.68,"text":"So, the second question is from Thomas,"},{"start":1361.28,"duration":5.8,"text":"and then he says, \"How can graph handle"},{"start":1364.04,"duration":5.16,"text":"restrict restricted information if not"},{"start":1367.08,"duration":3.52,"text":"every user is allowed to access every"},{"start":1369.2,"duration":2.68,"text":"document?\""},{"start":1370.6,"duration":3.36,"text":">> Can you repeat that?"},{"start":1371.88,"duration":5.04,"text":">> How can graph handle restricted"},{"start":1373.96,"duration":5.6,"text":"information if not every user is allowed"},{"start":1376.92,"duration":3.76,"text":"to access every document?"},{"start":1379.56,"duration":2.32,"text":">> Okay."},{"start":1380.68,"duration":2.32,"text":"Thomas."},{"start":1381.88,"duration":3.36,"text":"Um"},{"start":1383.0,"duration":6.32,"text":"good question."},{"start":1385.24,"duration":5.84,"text":"Uh, yeah, Thomas. No, yeah, Thomas. Uh,"},{"start":1389.32,"duration":5.04,"text":"you can uh,"},{"start":1391.08,"duration":5.92,"text":"you can create user management and"},{"start":1394.36,"duration":7.2,"text":"create different graphs to be different"},{"start":1397.0,"duration":5.84,"text":"user and split like restrict usage"},{"start":1401.56,"duration":5.04,"text":"between them."},{"start":1402.84,"duration":5.6,"text":"Uh, we at Faculty B have this ability."},{"start":1406.6,"duration":5.32,"text":"Uh, I will state with you, I didn't"},{"start":1408.44,"duration":6.16,"text":"build it. Uh, but we have the ability to"},{"start":1411.92,"duration":5.04,"text":"create restriction between graphs."},{"start":1414.6,"duration":4.2,"text":"Uh, single connection to Faculty B with"},{"start":1416.96,"duration":3.64,"text":"single single database, you have"},{"start":1418.8,"duration":4.2,"text":"multi-tenancy. So, you can create graphs"},{"start":1420.6,"duration":5.08,"text":"and graphs and graphs and you can choose"},{"start":1423.0,"duration":4.24,"text":"which graph is allowed to which users."},{"start":1425.68,"duration":4.44,"text":"Also,"},{"start":1427.24,"duration":4.88,"text":"I saw uh, use cases when you namespacing"},{"start":1430.12,"duration":3.68,"text":"and know a knowledge into the in the"},{"start":1432.12,"duration":3.64,"text":"knowledge graph and when you retrieve"},{"start":1433.8,"duration":4.8,"text":"them, you filter it based on the on the"},{"start":1435.76,"duration":7.68,"text":"user. But, we at Faculty B believe full"},{"start":1438.6,"duration":4.84,"text":"isolation is the is the way to solve it."}]}